{"h":"<h1>Aquair-XL 和 DawnHaze-pony 的示例工作流程</h1><p>由于包含许多自定义节点，如果缺少任何自定义节点，请在 ComfyUI 中“安装缺少的自定义节点”。</p><p>也请大家注意检查站！</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://civitai.com/models/783923?modelVersionId=876700\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">水瓶-XL</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://civitai.com/models/774716?modelVersionId=876700\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">黎明薄雾小马</a></p></li></ul><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/a370d3ef-418c-4a0a-82a6-6438aed579d8/width=525/a370d3ef-418c-4a0a-82a6-6438aed579d8.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>","lang":"en","v":2,"o":{"en":"<h1>Sample workflow for Aquair-XL &amp; DawnHaze-pony</h1><p>Since many custom nodes are included, please “Install Missing Custom Nodes” within ComfyUI if any are missing.</p><p>Please take care of the checkpoints too!</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://civitai.com/models/783923?modelVersionId=876700\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">Aquair-XL</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://civitai.com/models/774716?modelVersionId=876700\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">DawnHaze-pony</a></p></li></ul><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/a370d3ef-418c-4a0a-82a6-6438aed579d8/width=525/a370d3ef-418c-4a0a-82a6-6438aed579d8.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>"}}